OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA partly cloudy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle along
OL,7,Feastern coasts, clearing north through
OL,8,Fthe morning. A dry and bright
OL,9,Fafternoon, with some sunny intervals
OL,10,Fin the west. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIncreasingly cloudy with
OL,13,Fspells of rain developing once again
OL,14,Fthrough the evening, and overnight.
OL,15,FRain will gradually move westward,
OL,16,Fbecoming drier along eastern coasts.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain through much
OL,19,Fof Tuesday, this heavy over western
OL,20,Fparts. The best of any drier spells
OL,21,Falong eastern coasts. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
