OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy Wednesday with heavy
OL,7,Frain and strong winds moving westward.
OL,8,FDrier and brighter Thursday with light
OL,9,Fwinds and sunny spells. Heavy showers
OL,10,Fand strong winds Friday. Temperatures
OL,11,Fnear normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
